      "claim": "Pitolisant, a lipophilic H3 antagonist with a piperidine and chlorophenyl-propoxy ether, shows good oral absorption and brain penetration in rodents; this positive CNS result is not transferable to the query because the query is a strongly basic guanidine with no lipophilic aromatic/ether system.",
      "evidence_role": "contradictory"
